 sequenceDiagram — arrows, notes and    
 blocks                                 
 ────────────────────────────────────── 
                                        
 ╭ mermaid ───────────────────────────╮ 
 │ sequenceDiagram                    │ 
 │   participant A as Ana             │ 
 │   actor B as Bo                    │ 
 │   A->>B: solid open                │ 
 │   B-->>A: dashed open              │ 
 │   A-x B: solid cross               │ 
 │   A->>A: a self message            │ 
 │   activate B                       │ 
 │   Note over A,B: a note over both  │ 
 │   Note right of B: a note on one › │ 
 │   alt happy path                   │ 
 │     B->>A: ok                      │ 
 │   else sad path                    │ 
 │     B->>A: not ok                  │ 
 │   end                              │ 
 │   loop three times                 │ 
 │     A->>B: again                   │ 
 │   end                              │ 
 │   deactivate B                     │ 
